!Series_title	"Analysis of gene expression in esophageal squamous cell carcinoma (ESCC)"
!Series_geo_accession	"GSE20347"
!Series_status	"Public on Mar 15 2011"
!Series_submission_date	"Feb 16 2010"
!Series_last_update_date	"Dec 06 2018"
!Series_pubmed_id	"20955586"
!Series_summary	"To characterize gene expression in esophageal squamous cell carcinoma, we examined gene expression in tumor and matched normal adjacent tissue from 17 ESCC patients from a high-risk region of China."
!Series_overall_design	"RNA was extracted from 17 micro-dissected tumor and matched normal tissue pairs using the PureLink Micro-to-Midi Total RNA Purification System (Invitrogen, Carlsbad, CA)"
!Series_overall_design	"Affymetrix HG-U133A 2.0 gene expression arrays were performed according to the manufacturer's directions."
!Series_overall_design	"The Robust Multiarray Average (RMA) algorithm implemented in Bioconductor in R was used for background correction and normalization across all samples."
!Series_type	"Expression profiling by array"
!Series_contributor	"Robert,J,Clifford"
!Series_contributor	"Nan,,Hu"
!Series_contributor	"Maxwell,P,Lee"
!Series_contributor	"Philip,R,Taylor"
